8,A Mixtec Sound Change Database - Journal of Open Humanities Data,https://openhumanitiesdata.metajnl.com/articles/10.5334/johd.184,"We present an interlinked, expandable database of segmental sound changes among a large sample of Mixtec languages of Mexico. The database provides an up-to-date repository for scholars working on Mixtec and related languages.","Mixtec, Tidaá",Otomanguean
